    "sdet_plan.json's element_locator_handoff was empty (no design_context.json was available at plan time), so there was no expected logical-ID shopping list to check the build against. All 21 elements below were captured because the dev manifest declared them, not because they closed a pre-declared gap — treat the stable-ID gate result as informational, not a completeness guarantee, until design_context.json is produced and the plan is regenerated.",
